  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "2f355cd8-f557-468b-bd31-c89bd4b606f8"],
 ". Use functions logP(logM,logR) and logR(logL, logM) to change this to the \
form ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"logMdot", "=", 
    RowBox[{"a", "+", 
