  3.797720545473689*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"236da54f-a756-4770-9400-\
1f59df0155a5"],

Cell["\<\
logR = -0.115+0.68 logL+0.088 log(Z/Zsun)-0.52 log(alpha)
logM = -3.49578+2.12 logL-1.96078 logP+0.274353 log(Z/Zsun)-1.62118 log(alpha)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7977205549382963`*^9, 3.7977205835583305`*^9}, {
